 "notes": "This is the sprite move list. tools/gaelic_forge.py still builds the 3D sculpted player from the game skeleton and does not read this pack. profiles/gaelic36.json still builds the procedural sports motions if you do not pass --game. A shared clip (both dives use 'save') is a limit of the starter library, not a second dive animation. v11.24: \"figure\": 0.58 draws the player at 58% of the frame height (packs default to 62%) so the leap catch (jump and raised hands) stays inside the 160 px cell.",
